  <!--
    Reference-data tables move from the legacy dbo schema to the deploy schema and
    take the deploy column convention (docs/tag-schema-standardisation).

    These operations are what make the move data-preserving: SqlPackage reads them
    when it generates the deployment script and emits ALTER SCHEMA TRANSFER /
    sp_rename instead of diffing dbo.DATABASE against deploy.Database and deciding
    the latter is a brand new, empty table. A pre-deployment script cannot do this
    job — the script is generated from the pre-migration state of the target, so
    the generated CREATE TABLE would collide with whatever a pre-deploy rename had
    already produced.

    Order matters: the schema move comes first, and each column rename below names
    its parent as the move left it — [deploy].[DATABASE], not [dbo].[DATABASE].

    There is deliberately no table-rename operation here. The model collation is
    case-insensitive (1033,CI), so DacFx compares DATABASE to Database, finds them
    equal and discards the rename; chaining it through a staging name does not help
    either, because DacFx collapses the chain before emitting anything. Recording
    such an operation anyway would only write a dead key into dbo.__RefactorLog,
    permanently marking as applied something that never ran. Table and primary-key
    casing is handled instead by
    Scripts/Post-Deployment/ApplyDeployCasingToRefDataTables.sql.
  -->
  <Operation Name="Move Schema" Key="6d26fd55-8f83-42ff-8e17-726da1a5eb9f" ChangeDateTime="08/10/2026 09:00:00">
    <Property Name="ElementName" Value="[dbo].[DATABASE]" />
    <Property Name="ElementType" Value="SqlTable" />
    <Property Name="NewSchema" Value="deploy" />
    <Property Name="IsNewSchemaExternal" Value="False" />
  </Operation>
  <Operation Name="Rename Refactor" Key="3694aba9-4e94-4e86-aae5-52fdb45ca634" ChangeDateTime="08/10/2026 09:00:02">
    <Property Name="ElementName" Value="[deploy].[Database].[DB_ID]" />
    <Property Name="ElementType" Value="SqlSimpleColumn" />
    <Property Name="ParentElementName" Value="[deploy].[Database]" />
    <Property Name="ParentElementType" Value="SqlTable" />
    <Property Name="NewName" Value="Id" />
  </Operation>
